sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as TodayScreen
    participant C as TodayController
    participant UC as StartWork / StopWork
    participant R as WorkSessionRepository
    participant DB as SQLite (drift)

    Note over U,DB: Start a work session
    U->>UI: tap Start
    UI->>C: start()
    C->>UC: start(now)
    UC->>R: open(WorkSession(startedAt: now, endedAt: null))
    R->>DB: INSERT open session
    DB-->>R: ok
    R-->>UC: session
    UC-->>C: open session
    C-->>UI: state = running
    UI-->>U: live timer (derived from startedAt, no background counter)

    Note over U,DB: Stop the work session
    U->>UI: tap Stop
    UI->>C: stop()
    C->>UC: stop(now)
    UC->>R: close(sessionId, endedAt: now)
    R->>DB: UPDATE ended_at
    DB-->>R: ok
    R-->>UC: closed session
    UC-->>C: closed session
    C-->>UI: state = idle + today total
    UI-->>U: show session duration + daily total
